   transform flows and the player's own prompts, which get the facts alone). #}
{% set _debt_info = debt_context(npc.UUID) %}
{% if _debt_info != "" %}
## Financial Obligations
{{ _debt_info }}
{% if render_mode == "full" and default(responseTarget.type, "none") != "none" %}
**Settling tabs:**
- When someone with an open tab asks for an item, select the **Items** action category, then **GiveItem**: its value goes on their tab by itself, so do not charge it again.
- For a charge with no item (a service, a fee, another round), select the **Economy** action category, then **AddToDebt**.
- When someone pays down their tab, select the **Economy** action category, then **CollectPayment** for the amount paid; it takes that much off the tab.
- When you pay what you owe, select the **Economy** action category, then **RepayDebt**.
- To lower or cancel what someone owes you without coin changing hands, select the **Economy** action category, then **ReduceDebt** or **ForgiveDebt**.
- Settle a tab with **CollectPayment** or **RepayDebt**, never with a gift.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}